<p>Israel said on Sunday it was widening its campaign against Hezbollah in Lebanon with expanded ground and air operations, and by ordering strikes on bridges over the Litani River that Israeli officials said Hezbollah used to move reinforcements. Lebanese officials said the bridge attacks violated Lebanese sovereignty and warned they could be a prelude to a broader ground push, especially after Israel’s military leadership said the operation had only begun and could last for some time. One strike damaged the Qasmiyeh bridge near Tyre, a key crossing on the coastal highway linking southern and central Lebanon, disrupting movement in an area already under heavy strain from the conflict. The new military steps deepened fears in Lebanon that Israel is trying to widen a buffer zone in the south, even as the stated military aim remains weakening Hezbollah’s ability to move fighters and supplies across the Litani corridor.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/9BucZPJHCDUNrzekwQKD1frLasd7AsEee9p3FSG_hmdiOChKBRMT5m_8CErfAg-Roo4snO7Hr64uoG7FZMIGbrlsrAk8mLCpIx7pNhTt9GlM1i8fiuPXtN7A_wawDBv2miLO_K6RO6UTVlJVnoxM77S5O4kLSM6bpmxxvUB9ase9ROHAxnrxZ6PJ7hhcZSZP6mLkSbA1Bg308BPxlLyp9egoioyK5ystMDm3t4BJqediRA' alt='Cars turn around on a bridge in southern Lebanon after an Israeli strike destroyed it on Sunday.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Buffer zone: The New York Times reported that the demolition of bridges and buildings has raised concern that Israel is widening a military-controlled buffer zone in southern Lebanon.</li><li>Route disruption: The damaged Qasmiyeh crossing sits on one of the main coastal routes between southern and central Lebanon, so its loss matters for civilian movement as well as military logistics.</li><li>Evacuation pressure: The United Nations human rights chief criticized Israel’s actions in Lebanon, including broad evacuation orders that Dawn said have displaced more than one million people.</li><li>Border demolitions: Alongside the bridge strikes, Israeli forces were instructed to intensify the demolition of homes near the southern border, marking a broader expansion of military activity beyond direct battlefield clashes.</li></ul><blockquote>Has only begun - Israeli army chief</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Israel Defense Minister Israel Katz: He ordered troops to destroy more bridges and buildings in southern Lebanon as part of a broader escalation against Hezbollah. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/22/world/middleeast/israel-lebanon-fighting-hezbollah.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li><li>Lebanese President Joseph Aoun: He said the bridge strikes were a prelude to a ground invasion and called them flagrant violations of Lebanese sovereignty. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/22/lebanons-aoun-calls-israel-strikes-on-bridges-prelude-to-ground-invasion'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li><li>Lama al-Fares: The resident who lives near the crossing said her family fled after seeing the warning and feared their rebuilt home beside the bridge might not survive the strike. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1984486/israeli-war-on-lebanon-escalates-with-announcement-of-ground-operations'>Dawn</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c30rl05evd8o'>Israel to expand ground and air attacks against Hezbollah in Lebanon</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/israel-advance-ground-operations-lebanon-after-striking-key-bridge'>Israel to advance ground operations in Lebanon after striking key bridge</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/3/22/israel-vows-to-escalate-campaign-against-hezbollah-in-lebanon'>Israel vows to escalate campaign against Hezbollah in Lebanon</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1984486/israeli-war-on-lebanon-escalates-with-announcement-of-ground-operations'>Israeli war on Lebanon escalates with announcement of ground operations</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/22/world/middleeast/israel-lebanon-fighting-hezbollah.html'>Israel Orders Military to Intensify Demolitions in Southern Lebanon</a> - nytimes.com</li></ul>